:: Abandoned Subway
<<set $location to "underground">><<set $outside to 0>>
<<effects>>
<<set $subway = Math.clamp($subway, 0, 100)>>
You are in an abandoned tunnel once part of a subway network, old maintenance lights barely light the dark tunnels.
<br><br>


