:: Passout Subway

You've pushed yourself too much.
<br><br>
<<passout>>
<<ambulance>>
<<pass 1 hour>>
<<trauma 6>><<set $stress -= 2000>>


/* High street - both lines */
:: Subway Central Station 
<<set $location to "underground">><<set $outside to 0>>
<<effects>>
You are in the old central station of the abandoned subway network, the eerily abandoned interior is dimly lit by some old maintenance lights that somehow still have power.
<br><br>

	<<link [[Walk to Residential Station (0:10)|Subway Residential Station]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
	<<link [[Walk to Industrial Station (0:10)|Subway Industrial Station]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
	<<link [[Walk to Docks Station (0:10)|Subway Docks Station]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br><br>

	<<link [[Exit to Storm Drains (0:10)|Commercial Drain]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>



/* domus street - red line */
:: Subway Residential Station 
<<set $location to "underground">><<set $outside to 0>>
<<effects>>
You are in an abandoned station that was once the residential district connection to the subway line. the door to the surface has long been sealed.
<br><br>
	
	<<link [[Walk to Central Station (0:10)|Subway Central Station]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
	<<link [[Walk into the dark mineshaft(0:30)|Subway Forest Mineshafts]]>><<pass 30>><</link>><br><br>

	<<link [[Exit to Storm Drains (0:10)|Residential Drain]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>



/* Harvest street - Red line */
:: Subway Industrial Station 
<<set $location to "underground">><<set $outside to 0>>
<<effects>>
You are in an abandoned tunnel once part of a subway network, old maintenance lights barely light the dark tunnels.
<br><br>

	<<link [[Walk to Central Station (0:10)|Subway Central Station]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>

	<<if !$vampire_room_discovered>>
		<<link [[Investigate hole in wall (0:10)|Subway Vampire Room]]>><<pass 10>><<set $vampire_room_discovered to true>><</link>><br><br>
	<<else>> 
		<<link [[Enter Coffin Room (0:10)|Subway Vampire Room]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br><br>
	<</if>>

	<<link [[Exit to Storm Drains (0:10)|Industrial Drain]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>



