:: Subway Vampire Room
<<set $location to "underground">><<set $outside to 0>>
<<effects>>
<span class="lblue">You have entered a strangely decorated dark room.</span> A decayed wooden coffin sits in front of you, you have a feeling that you probably shouldn't disturb it.
<br><br>

	<<if !$weekly.abandonedsubwayBlastingCap>>
		<<link [[Open Coffin (0:10)|Subway Open]]>><<pass 10>><<set $weekly.abandonedsubwayBlastingCap to true>><</link>><br>
	<</if>>

	<<link [[Exit to Station (0:10)|Subway Industrial Station]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>


:: Subway Open
<<effects>>

You open the old crate. Inside is a pile of old machinery and tools, but something catches your eye. you pick up some kind of old device of unknown use, someone in the museum might know what it was used for.
<<set $antiquemoney += 2500>><<museumAntiqueStatus "antiqueblastingcap" "found">>
<br><br>
<<set $pursuit += 1>>
<<if $museumAntiques.antiques.antiqueconductorwhistle isnot "found" and $museumAntiques.antiques.antiqueconductorwhistle isnot "talk" and $museumAntiques.antiques.antiqueconductorwhistle isnot "museum">>
	<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 1000>>
	<<caveicon "treasure">><<link [[Examine the crate more closely|Abandoned Subway Examine]]>><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>>
	<br>
<</if>>

<<link [[Leave|Subway Vampire Room]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Abandoned Subway Examine
<<effects>>


You sort through the rest of the contents of the crate, searching for something of value.
<br><br>

<<skulduggerycheck>>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	/*<<earnFeat "X Marks the Spot">>*/
	After a number of minutes searching through the debris you see a near imperceptible spot of shiny metal underneath the rusted tools, upon rummaging to the bottom of the crate you manage to grab hold of whatever it was. <span class="green">you pull out an old silver whistle</span> from the base of the container.
	<br><br>
	<<set $antiquemoney += 4000>><<museumAntiqueStatus "antiqueconductorwhistle" "found">>
	You inspect the whistle, it appears to be a conductor's whistle from when the subway planned to open, it might be valuable.
	<br><br>
	<<skulduggeryuse>>

	<<link [[Next|Abandoned Subway]]>><</link>>
	<br>

<<else>>

	As you are searching the crate one of the maintenance lights fails leaving the area in absolute darkness, the crate is too heavy to move and unable to see its contents you have to move on.<<gstress>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>

	<<skulduggeryuse>>

	<<link [[Next|Abandoned Subway]]>><</link>>
	<br>

<</if>>


:: Subway Exit
<<effects>>

You push the heavy door open once more and exit the dark tunnels.
<br><br>
<<abandoned_subway_end>>
<<link [[Next|Industrial Drain]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Subway Entrance
<<set $location to "underground">><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>


You push the heavy door open and enter the dark tunnels.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Abandoned Subway]]>><<set $subway to 0>><<beach_cave_init>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>
